      "title": "결제 도메인 구조",
      "code": "sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as Client\n  participant S as PaymentService\n  participant A as TossAdapter\n  participant R as RefundService\n  C->>S: charge(order)\n  S->>A: requestPayment\n  A-->>S: paymentId\n  S-->>C: ok\n  C->>S: refund(orderId)\n  S->>R: createRefund\n  R->>A: cancelPayment\n  A-->>R: ok\n  R-->>C: refundId"
    }
  ],

